Package: mcommander
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, ${perl:Depends},
         python3:any
Recommends: mailcap, perl, sensible-utils, unzip
Suggests: mcommander-plugins, aspell, hunspell
Conflicts: mc6, mc6-data
Description: Modular TUI file manager with a tiny core, based on GNU Midnight Commander
 Based on GNU Midnight Commander, with dynamically loaded panel plugins.  It
 installs /usr/bin/mcommander and the mc6, mcedit6, mview, mdiff and mctree
 symlinks, and can be installed beside the mc package.

Package: mcommander-plugins
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends},
         mcommander (= ${binary:Version})
Enhances: mcommander
Conflicts: mc6-plugins
Description: M-Commander -- panel plugins
 Dynamic panel plugins for Git, Docker, Kubernetes, MongoDB, S3, FTP,
 SFTP, Samba, systemd, shell links, panelize and archive management.

Package: mcommander-lua
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends},
         mcommander (= ${binary:Version})
Enhances: mcommander
Description: M-Commander -- Lua runtime extension
 The Lua runtime plugin and the scripts that come with it, including the
 sixel and markdown viewers.  Without this package M-Commander runs, and
 the features written in Lua are absent.
